Exam Scores</b>

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.290
<b>Kimihara 
Himeno</b>

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.840
<b>602
 Inukai Michi</b>

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:23.220
<b>Midterm 
Exam 
Scores</b>

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:34.950
What's with you?

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:37.520
Let's see, you're...

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:42.230
<b>Students ranked below 300 
will take supplementary lessons 
and a make-up exam. 

00:21:41.210 --> 00:21:42.230
Oh...

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.140
Well, that's bad.

00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:51.560
That's what happens when you 
slack off all the time.

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:55.440
Now, come on. Let's all study together.

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:58.090
Don't spoil her so much, Hime.

